# back-end environment variables are managed from the project root.
# See /.env.example for the full variable reference.
#
# For local development (uv run fastapi dev):
#   Option A (recommended): symlink back-end/.env to the root
#     ln -s ../.env .env
#
#   Option B: copy the root .env.example here and fill in values
#     cp ../.env.example .env
